DecomposableSparseSystems -- Solving decomposable sparse polynomial systems
***************************************************************************

Description
===========

There are two natural ways a sparse polynomial system can be decomposed in the
sense of (T. Brysiewicz, J. I. Rodriguez, F. Sottile, and T. Yahl, Solving
Decomposable Sparse Systems, arXiv:2001.04228, 2019). These methods detect and
compute these decompositions and use them to compute solutions.

